    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>Independent Droids can choose to have their <a href=\"/wiki/Droid_Immunities\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid Immunities\">Droid Immunities</a> not apply to any <a href=\"/wiki/Mind-Affecting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind-Affecting\">Mind-Affecting</a> effects, allowing them to benefit from <a href=\"/wiki/Mind-Affecting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind-Affecting\">Mind-Affecting</a> abilities that provide positive effects.</p><p>Additionally, Independent Droids have permanently disabled their <a href=\"/wiki/Behavioral_Inhibitor\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Behavioral Inhibitor\">Behavioral Inhibitor</a>, enabling them to take any desired action they wish. Furthermore, Independent Droids are immune to the effects of <a href=\"/wiki/Restraining_Bolt\" title=\"Restraining Bolt\">Restraining Bolts</a>.</p>",
